  m_Name: Carta_BiodigestorComunitario
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Metis.Runtime::KnowledgeEntryData
  _title: "Biodigestor Comunit\xE1rio"
  _titleEn: Community Biodigester
  _category: 0
  _unlockTrigger: 0
  _summary: "Restos de comida e esterco fermentam num tanque fechado e viram biog\xE1s
    para cozinhar e gerar energia, e o que sobra vira adubo para hortas e lavouras."
  _summaryEn: Food scraps and manure ferment in a sealed tank and become biogas for
    cooking and power, and what is left becomes fertilizer for gardens and farms.
  _realWorld: "A \xCDndia mant\xE9m um programa nacional de biog\xE1s desde 1981,
    com cerca de 5 milh\xF5es de biodigestores dom\xE9sticos, e a China tinha cerca
    de 28 milh\xF5es funcionando em 2008."
  _realWorldEn: India has run a national biogas program since 1981, with about 5
    million household digesters, and China had about 28 million in operation in 2008.
  _tradeOffs: "O biodigestor precisa de manuten\xE7\xE3o e de gente treinada: nas
    campanhas chinesas dos anos 1970, muitos foram constru\xEDdos \xE0s pressas e
    funcionaram mal."
  _tradeOffsEn: 'A digester needs maintenance and trained people: in China''s campaigns
    of the 1970s, many were built in a hurry and worked poorly.'
  _sources:
  - Label: "Energetica India, programa nacional de biog\xE1s (2018)"
    Url: https://www.energetica-india.net/news/under-the-nbmmp-about-496-lakh-household-size-biogas-plants-have-been-installed
  - Label: Biogas Technology in China (energypedia)
    Url: https://energypedia.info/wiki/Biogas_Technology_in_China
